  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The HTTP file upload API located at \"https://vrchat.com/api/1/icon\" fails to sanitize the uploaded file. \nThe game will render images up to 16,000x16,000 pixels, and the API is capped to 200MB.\nAdditionally, files that do not match their header are not correctly identified, the only thing that determines whether an image is truly an image is the file extension.\nThis can cause unexpected issues when you load corrupted images, such as JPEGs that have been manipulated to uncompress very largely.\nOn file upload, the file should be re-rendered by the server before being stored permanently to ensure that it is properly sanitized, not too large, and compressed properly.",
